KeywordAbility(
    name: "squad",
    params: [Cost],
    spelling: "squad <Param(0)>",
    grammar: FixedKeyword(
        surface: "squad",
    ),
    // STOP. "Squad [cost]" means "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may pay
    // [cost] ANY NUMBER OF TIMES" and "When this creature enters, if its squad cost was
    // paid, create a token that's a copy of it for each time its squad cost was paid."
    // [CR#702.157a] `StaticSpec::AddedCost` carries a cost and an `offered` flag and no
    // repetition count, so "any number of times" cannot be written (the cause Replicate
    // shares). Its second ability, an enters trigger, is checked against its own regime
    // since `lean-keyword-definition-regimes` and no longer blocks it.
)
